# Purpose: git ignore rules for manuals-rag. Version: v1 (2026-09-30)
# Scope: PRODUCTION-candidate (manuals-rag). Architecture: keeps derived corpus + venv out of git.
# Invocation: n/a (read by git once this folder becomes a repo)
# corpus/ = text DERIVED from copyrighted manuals: local only, never committed, published or pushed.
corpus/
# index/ = the vector index built FROM the corpus (rag/ingest.py) - same rule: local only, never pushed.
index/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
